=\"跟男友結婚前發現的秘密（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230711/755426375825625088046573.png/BPJbuQcEefqfh1zfvAV6PX7NBQyf7KcD5wwzzucMM84\"/><figcaption>跟男友結婚前發現的秘密（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"跟男友結婚前發現的秘密（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230711/755426378501722112170942.png/O-oOslHLfJQqSV4FONMGmA-PSB6Rm5CxptAqqKbQKqg\"/><figcaption>跟男友結婚前發現的秘密（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"跟男友結婚前發現的秘密（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230711/755426381047795712635972.png/0NEthrsqsuCxh1NSAEjk1woBDueoGi8ivULy7L1C8uw\"/><figcaption>跟男友結婚前發現的秘密（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"跟男友結婚前發現的秘密（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230711/755426383606452224498726.png/vzIfeA7PuUk70aFoCQjl_CVcdQcmvspehqKs8IairPA\"/><figcaption>跟男友結婚前發現的秘密（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"跟男友結婚前發現的秘密（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230711/755426358028406784846902.png/eaeXgBPtiiO-vrEgACJUlPfh0Ib17m4wTUSbrk1Em64\"/><figcaption>跟男友結婚前發現的秘密（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網友留言（截圖自Dcard）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230711/755429330804281344596872.png/erwQGVJpMMZbrspWSVX3OCCyksKHJ9FWwu0qvMLtKrw\"/><figcaption>網友留言（截圖自Dcard）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網友留言（截圖自Dcard）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230711/755429333195165696168254.png/Z9mIjKOO5wNQ-xMBOz1-9tdfm38X1zCVusQBJLrEASQ\"/><figcaption>網友留言（截圖自Dcard）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網友留言（截圖自Dcard）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230711/755429335342780416219860.png/-HaIXj7ZQRnvwt4PKIeQAq_goQNvEp2qKIALfSiAC30\"/><figcaption>網友留言（截圖自Dcard）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網友留言（截圖自Dcard）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230711/755429337482006528978031.png/5uWGut6ScmVD_EV3dMcOk43akuM_YXzUNluJ_DZbifw\"/><figcaption>網友留言（截圖自Dcard）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網友留言（截圖自Dcard）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230711/755429339751256064186925.png/i0wTPmCbKGiEChiaoSzdJkX76VlkgWbpY-3DwWPtw8E\"/><figcaption>網友留言（截圖自Dcard）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網友留言（截圖自Dcard）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230711/755429341672378368241578.png/3hLp8rM-A542adhvpp7iRFhWR7Q546Ou4qobFuKqGxY\"/><figcaption>網友留言（截圖自Dcard）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網友留言（截圖自Dcard）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230711/755429344113594368106897.png/PL1Oci69zZRPgMCgi4iIM8-8jtLa-lE9_cUnrv3FJ64\"/><figcaption>網友留言（截圖自Dcard）</figcaption></figure><p>更讓他傻眼的是，女友自稱有潔癖，卻不准他買馬桶刷，理由是覺得刷子很髒，不想在浴室看到，寧可使用馬桶清潔錠，即使馬桶上的髒污、尿垢無法清乾淨也不在意。</p><p>最誇張的是，女友要求他不論什麼季節，在家上大號都必須「全身脫光」，以免衣物碰到馬桶，上完廁所除了擦拭，還得用蓮蓬頭沖洗。原PO無奈表示，即使女友不在家，也會特地詢問他當天有沒有上大號、是否按照規定進行，讓他壓力相當大。</p><p>貼文曝光後，不少網友認為，同居反而讓原PO提早看清雙方的生活習慣，紛紛留言：</p><p>「不是耶，你這是勸先同居吧」</p><p>「不是常有網友說婚前發現，都一律當作喜事嗎？」</p><p>「恭喜，露餡了，慶幸早發現，不然未來（婚後）生活就長這樣」</p><p>「就是因為這樣才要婚前同居吧」</p><p>不過，也有人認為原PO自己也有責任，直言「同居前完全沒討論好共識，交往那麼久溝通還有問題，表示之前完全沒有在溝通，你都是照單全收」。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：女生跟男友同居即揭「特殊家庭沖涼習慣」勁尷尬　網民：真開放】男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211208/545299825424338944382061.png/oVbyT9i8GOlYPu1GxJGCNByTQ0_WYWBa6OJnxujiZ8Y\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：女生跟男友同居即揭「特殊家庭沖涼習慣」勁尷尬　網民：真開放】男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Stefan Vladimirov/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211208/545299827433541632926074.png/pPqHCx69lkxliItPtpjU4ih9ZPjBtao1E6mgUxOpoFM\"/><figcaption>男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Stefan Vladimirov/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Stefan Vladimirov/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211208/545299829681819648892673.png/sP1J_9_cI4IilbGQARe1knAjWbuOquQxhwdOF4cHThc\"/><figcaption>男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Stefan Vladimirov/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Yehleen gaffney/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211208/545299831993012224374690.png/-dVjNSz3uaoWY2XfH5KzYoSAfcfXgBP_dq5CcHauQnA\"/><figcaption>男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Yehleen gaffney/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Yehleen gaffney/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211208/545299834983682048128405.png/_6Z3neMxrD2fge4BhdQMaq8CA3VyJSloP0XQ3z9F0N8\"/><figcaption>男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Yehleen gaffney/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Francesca Tosolini/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211208/545299837303263232201735.png/XIizRt5hm5rK83VzceGVZuQjObS9bD_J-OV1FPjldRQ\"/><figcaption>男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Francesca Tosolini/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Francesca Tosolini/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211208/545299840797249536846902.png/ZCv9oF3iceP3ZTk8k7vJSHqFfkrZhXwNfT75Vn0--VY\"/><figcaption>男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Francesca Tosolini/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Francesca Tosolini/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211208/545299843553038336204159.png/nnFDzYu4iZUYsGxwFs-ZOLOwBdr0pfU_6LVSbOi1Umw\"/><figcaption>男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Francesca Tosolini/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Chastity Cortijo/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211208/545299846275272704865372.png/gYFC-hAx_reaNxTvUoCHwXA1oZqT7X_SmO_NPJjvzTw\"/><figcaption>男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Chastity Cortijo/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Chastity Cortijo/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211208/545299848410304512594613.png/T3RpBk_nYhzPWHFa0p60HCcgzxH0SJ0on3SD_J90g_w\"/><figcaption>男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Chastity Cortijo/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211208/545299823251689472036289.png/ohX3UQ5BoLlNb19M9EIZ6xfZKzXeswNrvvXRjr710Y4\"/><figcaption>男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Christin Hume/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211208/545299825596436480064381.png/UvoZuxvsueQuCOaN9Zu8VjXid5Hog_zwwjekwMI3pMA\"/><figcaption>男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Christin Hume/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Christin Hume/unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211208/545299828142510080915347.png/gRajBy3IaWayZIkp6sgXiUAAF6VqOslyDlHY6Q5R2Ok\"/><figcaption>男友家庭特殊習慣（01製圖,圖: Christin Hume/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><p>車借弟弟吃虧？女友幫出氣槓弟媳害全家鬧僵 他爸媽氣炸勸分手</p><p>男友年薪250萬又優秀…她提2問題猶豫是否該結婚 網喊「快逃」：可能是假象</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:12:13.109751+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1840,"images":41,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T13:30:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T17:19:18.030397+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:38.496107+00:00","content_hash":"2501ba313a55c3336539c61f40c6732352e6e4d676fff32940ae3c705b235790","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}